### Login as demo user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Catalog search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalog?genre=Драма&minRating=7

### User watchlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/watchlist

### Add content to watchlist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaContentId": 2,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "rating": null
}

### Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/recommendations
